WEBVTT

NOTE Epilogue – The Phantom of the Opera at the Castle (Slovak immersive stage interpretation). Text and voice: Martin Horváth. English subtitles.

1
00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:10.440 line:-3
I feel my strength leaving me.

2
00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:20.220 line:-3
Yet it is neither illness nor age that is killing me –
I am dying of love,

3
00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:29.360 line:-3
of that power, the purest and the cruellest,
which I could not chain with the notes of my music.

4
00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:40.920 line:-3
Once, for a single unguarded moment,
I held her in my arms.

5
00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:47.020 line:-3
It was not a spectre, it was not a shadow –
it was a living being.

6
00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:57.000 line:-3
She wept with me, and her tears were worth more
than all the pearls and gold of my kingdom beneath the earth.

7
00:00:57.080 --> 00:01:03.560 line:-3
In that moment they washed away my mask,
washed away my curse,

8
00:01:03.640 --> 00:01:10.640 line:-3
the curse of my face,
and they made a man of me.

9
00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:21.640 line:-3
That is enough –
it is more than a monster can hope for.

10
00:01:22.940 --> 00:01:30.460 line:-3
My mother, weeping, gave me my first mask,
so that she would no longer have to look at me.

11
00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:34.800 line:-3
She never kissed me.

12
00:01:35.840 --> 00:01:38.340 line:-3
She ran from me.

13
00:01:38.900 --> 00:01:45.180 line:-3
I ran away from home,
and at the fairs they showed me as a living corpse.

14
00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:56.120 line:-3
I was only a spectre, an icy silence in the corridors;

15
00:01:56.200 --> 00:02:02.060 line:-3
to you I was a monster,
a swirl of dust in the darkness.

16
00:02:03.840 --> 00:02:12.460 line:-3
My palace crumbles into silence, and I go
where there is no longer any need to hide one’s face.

17
00:02:13.120 --> 00:02:16.120 line:-3
But I do not die alone –

18
00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:21.040 line:-3
I carry into the dark her pity,

19
00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:26.960 line:-3
one kiss, and the ring she gave back to me.

20
00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:40.140 line:-3
My mask falls,
but my music stays with you.

21
00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:45.560 line:-3
And remember:

22
00:02:45.920 --> 00:02:49.360 line:-3
your condemnation remains here for ever,

23
00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:53.000 line:-3
like my love for her…

24
00:03:04.600 --> 00:03:07.760 line:-3
Her pity…

25
00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:14.360 line:-3
Her tears…

26
00:03:18.720 --> 00:03:22.720 line:-3
My light…
